= アンケートの回答方法

  (1) (('tag:x-small'))github.com/oss-gate/workshop をfork
  (2) (('tag:x-small'))git clone git@github.com:${GITHUB_ID}/workshop.git
  (3) (('tag:x-small'))tutorial/retrospectives/${YYYY}-${MM}-${DD}-ruby-${LOCATION}
      * cp (('tag:x-small'))beginner.yaml beginner-${GITHUB_ID}.yaml
      * cp (('tag:x-small'))supporter.yaml supporter-${GITHUB_ID}.yaml
  (4) (('tag:x-small'))git switch -c retrospective
  (5) (('tag:x-small'))git add → git commit → git push
  (6) (('tag:x-small'))github.com/${GITHUB_ID}/workshopを開いて「Pull request」
